                "text": "I ran for Congress to protect Virginians\u2019 healthcare. Now, Trump and Republicans are threatening coverage for nearly 2M Virginians \u2014 including 700,000 kids.\n\nAs Governor, I\u2019ll work to protect Medicaid and stand up to anyone trying to take healthcare away from our families.",
