                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "House Republicans just voted to strip healthcare away from more than 250,000 Virginians \u2014 threatening rural hospitals, raising premiums for working families, and hurting small businesses.\n\nAs Governor, I\u2019ll always work to protect access to affordable care across Virginia.",
