                "retweet_count": 53,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Hundreds of thousands of Virginians have healthcare today because VA Democrats expanded Medicaid. Now, Republicans in D.C. are trying to roll it back \u2014 threatening coverage, rural hospitals, and higher costs. It\u2019s shameful.\n\nI\u2019ll always work to protect your care and lower costs.",
