                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Too many Virginians are struggling to afford the healthcare they need.\n\nAs Governor, I\u2019ll continue my work to lower healthcare and prescription drug costs \u2014 and protect every Virginian\u2019s ability to get healthcare coverage.",
