                "reply_count": 50,
                "retweet_count": 63,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The \u201cBig Beautiful Bill\u201d passed by Senate Republicans threatens care for hundreds of thousands Virginians, including many with disabilities. It puts Virginia's rural hospitals at risk, drives up costs, and forces families to delay the care they need.\n\nVirginians are already feeling the strain of high healthcare costs \u2014 and they deserve leaders who will protect coverage and lower expenses, not create more chaos.\n\nYou deserve a Governor who will speak up, not stay silent. As Governor, I\u2019ll always protect access to affordable care and stand up for the health and financial security of every family in the Commonwealth.",
                "text_lang": "en",
