                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "House Republicans \u2014 including all 5 from VA \u2014 voted to advance a bill that would threaten healthcare for more than 322,000 Virginians and leave at least 6 rural hospitals at risk of closing. Every elected official who votes for final passage should be ashamed. https://t.co/6vNYmIhmij",
