                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 91,
                "retweet_count": 76,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The legislation Donald Trump just signed into law is nowhere near as \"beautiful\" as the name claims. It's going to rip away healthcare from 322,000+ Virginians, and it puts 6 or more of our rural hospitals at risk of closing. There's nothing beautiful about that \u2014 yet all 5 House Republicans from VA voted for it. They should be ashamed of themselves.\n\nI know for so many Virginians, there's a lot of uncertainty about what happens next. Know that as Governor, I\u2019ll do everything I can to stand up to the chaos coming out of Washington and protect Virginians from the devastating effects of this legislation \u2014 because Virginians deserve a leader who will put our Commonwealth first.",
                "text_lang": "en",
